    "notes": "Found while landing X03: the adapter handed signals to an onDrift callback with nowhere to go, which is the same bookkeeping defect the audit recorded for loop detection - a signal nobody accumulates cannot be audited. ApsObservability gains totals.driftSignals and driftByKind plus recordDrift(), so detections land in the snapshot operators already read. Detect-only by construction: loop accounting (loopCandidates, replanRequested) is untouched and emptySnapshot reports zero signals, so a session without the switch on is byte-identical to before."
